>>
Rule 1 (x must be a real numeric tensor; disallow bool and complex)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8
>>
Rule 2 (x cannot be boolean)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 3 (x cannot be a complex tensor)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 9 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 10
>>
Rule 4 (name is a benign identifier string)
{v_2 : str} |= v_2 = "none" ∨ v_2 = "linear" ∨ v_2 = "sum"
>>
Rule 5 (tensor rank is defined and all dimension sizes are non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
